finition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"span_def_inclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"排除标准模块：既往对研究药或阳性对照不耐受；活动性严重感染；妊娠或哺乳；研究者判断不适合参加。","quote_sha256":"a84d3818dbfb446a1819a205cd6ee4dc82111a86ce76e0c7f1e0a9a3648a75d0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"span_def_exclusion"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_5","span_def_target_pop","span_def_pop_overview","span_def_indication","span_def_inclusion","span_def_exclusion"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[],"heading":"研究人群","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究计划纳入18–75岁、符合类风湿关节炎分类标准、经稳定剂量甲氨蝶呤治疗后仍为中高疾病活动度的成人受试者。研究适应症为甲氨蝶呤应答不足的活动性类风湿关节炎。受试者须满足入选标准，并且不满足排除标准后方可进入本研究。排除标准包括既往对研究药或阳性对照不耐受、活动性严重感染、妊娠或哺乳，以及研究者判断不适合参加。研究人群的年龄范围、背景甲氨蝶呤治疗状态和疾病活动度要求与本研究的目标人群一致。","rationale":"依据目标研究人群、研究人群概述、适应症及入选/排除标准模块撰写；医学作者需核对是否补充其他一般入选条件。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究人群）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_6e4142d7822b_95d1d7d60fef3ed0","section_number":"5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d7b5f605815b6376ab00671f","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922154858_11fc940e","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_6e4142d7822b_b209d029cdd23382:full-draft:d7b5f605815b6376ab00671f","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_6e4142d7822b_57ca278fb5cb04e9\n章节编号=5.3\n章节标题=入选标准\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=诊断类风湿关节炎至少6个月；筛选及基线时DAS28-CRP≥3.2；甲氨蝶呤稳定剂量治疗至少8周。","quote_sha256":"0ff979d42ca38c04a905d1c93d71a3443b4e63d572062f7e7246575055d66289","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:d7b5f605815b6376ab00671f","span_id":"span_sel_53"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"入选标准模块：诊断类风湿关节炎至少6个月；筛选及基线时DAS28-CRP≥3.2；甲氨蝶呤稳定剂量治疗至少8周。","quote_sha256":"aefd31a236bfd5c8fd6bbf69276263879baa4d2f85ae523d0fec21d0961772e0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"span_def_inclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"目标研究人群：18–75岁、稳定甲氨蝶呤治疗后仍为中高疾病活动度的类风湿关节炎成人试验参与者。","quote_sha256":"0ab47e23258a396edd7543a2d919116227f680bc2be10f409cc7c3364fdcb677","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"span_def_target_pop"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:revision:4","quote":"适应症：甲氨蝶呤应答不足的活动性类风湿关节炎","quote_sha256":"eca9992e916cd34fee0f67a733176948741bf9a58835f6aac1c25df9b5577e21","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c","span_id":"span_def_indication"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_53","span_def_inclusion","span_def_target_pop","span_def_indication"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[],"heading":"入选标准","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"拟入选本研究的受试者必须同时满足以下条件：年龄18–75岁；诊断为类风湿关节炎至少6个月；筛选期及基线时DAS28-CRP≥3.2；接受甲氨蝶呤稳定剂量治疗至少8周。上述标准共同界定甲氨蝶呤应答不足的活动性类风湿关节炎成人研究人群。受试者在筛选期及基线时的DAS28-CRP均需达到或超过3.2，且甲氨蝶呤稳定剂量治疗持续时间不少于8周。","rationale":"依据入选标准模块与目标研究人群撰写，年龄18–75岁、DAS28-CRP≥3.2及甲氨蝶呤稳定治疗至少8周均按原值写入；DAS28-CRP评估版本、授权和培训要求待医学作者核对。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（入选标准）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_6e4142d7822b_57ca278fb5cb04e9","section_number":"5.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d7b5f605815b6376ab00671f","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_ace846adc197b5363d2e:r4:20fc48105f14cc3c"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"83c0df4a8771c706733a1ea1d09d89762b8f043edf21da2d33609afaf9e05b53","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_6e4142d7822b_b209d029cdd23382: